    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "coding"
  },

  {
    "id": "es-037",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "La verdad es que está muy caro para nosotros",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-038",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Ya usamos otra herramienta para eso",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-039",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Lo tengo que pensar y lo consulto con mi jefe",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-040",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "No tenemos presupuesto para esto hasta el próximo año",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-041",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Me parece caro comparado con la competencia",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-042",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "No es el momento, estamos en medio de una migración",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-043",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Mándame la información por correo y lo vemos más adelante",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-044",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Estamos contentos con nuestro proveedor actual",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-045",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "No estoy seguro de que mi equipo lo vaya a usar",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-046",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Lo veo interesante pero tengo que consultarlo con el comité",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-047",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Por qué debería pagar más por lo mismo que ya tengo?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-048",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Otro proveedor nos ofrece lo mismo a mitad de precio",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-049",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Es que ahora mismo no es una prioridad para el equipo",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "objection"
  },

  {
    "id": "es-050",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Te refieres a la versión anterior?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-051",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Perdón, ¿puedes repetir la última parte?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-052",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿A qué te refieres con latencia aceptable?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-053",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Perdón, no te entendí bien, ¿qué dijiste del plan anual?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-054",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Quieres decir el entorno de producción o el de pruebas?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-055",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "cómo, no te escuché",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-056",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Espera, ¿la cifra que mencionaste es mensual o anual?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-057",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Podrías aclarar qué incluye el soporte premium?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "clarification"
  },

  {
    "id": "es-058",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Hola, buenos días",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-059",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Cómo estás?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-060",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Me escuchas bien?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-061",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Muchas gracias por tu tiempo",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-062",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Bueno, entonces empezamos cuando quieras",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-063",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Hola, ¿qué tal todo?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-064",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Se escucha bien? se me cortó un segundo",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-065",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Dame un segundo que comparto pantalla",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-066",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Gracias, igualmente, que tengas buen día",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-067",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Pueden ver mi pantalla?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-068",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Perfecto, perfecto, genial",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-069",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Mucho gusto, encantado de conocerte",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-070",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Empezamos?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-071",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Buenas tardes a todos, gracias por conectarse",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "smalltalk"
  },

  {
    "id": "es-072",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Hoy vamos a hablar del roadmap del siguiente trimestre",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-073",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "El presupuesto se aprobó la semana pasada",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-074",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Nosotros usamos Kubernetes para orquestar los microservicios del backend",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-075",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "La latencia promedio del pipeline bajó a doscientos milisegundos después de migrar a la nueva base de datos",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-076",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Cuando terminemos la integración te mando el documento con la arquitectura",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-077",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "No sé cómo lo hicieron pero el equipo entregó el proyecto a tiempo",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-078",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "El algoritmo que implementamos usa recursión y tiene complejidad logarítmica",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-079",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Te explico cómo funciona nuestro proceso de onboarding en tres pasos",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-080",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Lo que hicimos fue separar el modelo de datos por cliente para evitar conflictos",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-081",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Entonces quedamos en que el piloto arranca el lunes con tres usuarios",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-082",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Ella me preguntó por qué habíamos elegido ese proveedor y le expliqué los motivos",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-083",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Vale, lo anoto y te confirmo mañana",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-084",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Sí, eso lo tenemos cubierto con el plan actual",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-085",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Todavía no sabemos cuándo vamos a migrar a la nueva versión",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-086",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "Me preguntaron cuánto cuesta el plan anual y no supe qué responder",
    "isQuestion": false,
    "needsAnswer": false,
    "type": "other"
  },
  {
    "id": "es-087",
    "lang": "es",
    "text": "¿Hasta qué hora puedes quedarte hoy en la llamada?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "other"
  },

  {
    "id": "en-001",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Tell me about yourself",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-002",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Tell me about a time you failed and what you learned",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-003",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Why should we hire you?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-004",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "I'd love to hear how you prioritize when everything is urgent",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-005",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "so, um, tell me about a time you had to deal with a difficult stakeholder",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-006",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "what would you say is your biggest weakness",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-007",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Where do you see yourself in five years?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-008",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Describe a situation where you had to make a decision with incomplete information.",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-009",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "why are you leaving your current job",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-010",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "I'm curious how you handle feedback you disagree with",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-011",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Walk me through your resume",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-012",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Do you have any questions for us?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-013",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "What are your salary expectations?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-014",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "How do you handle working under pressure with tight deadlines",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-015",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Give me an example of when you led a team through a big change",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "behavioral"
  },

  {
    "id": "en-016",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "How does garbage collection work in Java?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "technical"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-017",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "What's the difference between a process and a thread?",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "technical"
  },
  {
    "id": "en-018",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Walk me through how you would design a URL shortener",
    "isQuestion": true,
    "needsAnswer": true,
    "type": "technical"
